    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Crafting</strong></h2>Create the factory parts, items and weapons to survive.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/8bb9bdea473998c17d372748ccc0cb26.poster.avif?t=1721919175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/8bb9bdea473998c17d372748ccc0cb26.webm?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/8bb9bdea473998c17d372748ccc0cb26.mp4?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Factory Building</strong></h2>Build factories that produce everything.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/c20cb911948e51ef0dd193ad0c1e5bff.poster.avif?t=1721919175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/c20cb911948e51ef0dd193ad0c1e5bff.webm?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/c20cb911948e51ef0dd193ad0c1e5bff.mp4?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Terraform</strong></h2>Change the earth to suit your needs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/99dc3a408d50879739639bd434fc715d.poster.avif?t=1721919175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/99dc3a408d50879739639bd434fc715d.webm?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/99dc3a408d50879739639bd434fc715d.mp4?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hovercraft</strong></h2>Explore the islands and escape from enemies with your hovercraft.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/125885a20ccd49725bc9a023bd2c4f47.poster.avif?t=1721919175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/125885a20ccd49725bc9a023bd2c4f47.webm?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/125885a20ccd49725bc9a023bd2c4f47.mp4?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Apocalyptic Survival</strong></h2>Hunt creatures and mine ores on different islands to get resources to survive.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/ad5c1b728a7a07cffdde57d19503e38d.poster.avif?t=1721919175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/ad5c1b728a7a07cffdde57d19503e38d.webm?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477310/extras/ad5c1b728a7a07cffdde57d19503e38d.mp4?t=1721919175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
